  "id": "pathophysiology",
  "term": "pathophysiology",
  "definition": "In this source, pathophysiology refers to the abnormal brain-circuit processes thought to underlie a disorder. For obsessive-compulsive disorder, it is described as dysregulation in cortico-striato-thalamo-cortical loops linking cognitive and affective circuits.",
